"btn btn-primary w-fit">Withdraw native</button></div></div><div class="card bg-base-100 border border-base-300 dark:border-white/10 shadow-sm"><div class="card-body"><h2 class="card-title">Withdraw token</h2><p class="text-sm text-base-content/70">Contract token balance: 0.000000000000000005 DAI</p><label class="fieldset"><span class="fieldset-legend">Token address</span><input data-component="AddressInput" placeholder="Token address" value="0xaf88d065e77c8cc2239327c5edb3a432268e5831"></label><label class="fieldset"><span class="fieldset-legend">Destination address</span><input data-component="AddressInput" placeholder="Destination address" value=""></label><label class="fieldset"><span class="fieldset-legend">Amount (DAI)</span><input class="input input-bordered w-full" placeholder="Amount (DAI)" value=""></label><div class="text-xs text-base-content/70">Detected decimals: 18</div><button class="btn btn-primary w-fit">Withdraw token</button></div></div><div class="card bg-base-100 border border-base-300 dark:border-white/10 shadow-sm xl:col-span-2"><div class="card-body"><h2 class="card-title">Transfer ownership</h2><p class="text-sm text-base-content/70">Move contract admin rights to another wallet.</p><label class="fieldset md:max-w-xl"><span class="fieldset-legend">New owner address</span><input data-component="AddressInput" placeholder="New owner address" value=""></label><button class="btn btn-error w-fit">Transfer ownership</button></div></div></div></div></div>"`;

exports[`AdminPage markup > renders the not-deployed alert when the paywall has no deployment 1`] = `"<div class="min-h-screen bg-base-200 p-6"><div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto alert alert-error"><span>\`TokenpingPaywall\` is not deployed on any configured target network.</span></div></div>"`;

